  "body": "All agents' buyers are welcomed. Contact Wayne and Emma for conjunction.\r\n\r\nDesigned across two generous levels, this home provides plenty of room for families to live, work and grow. Its north-facing aspect welcomes abundant natural light, while the elevated living areas create a wonderful sense of openness throughout the day.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the spacious lounge flows onto an expansive balcony-an inviting place to enjoy your morning coffee, entertain friends or simply relax in the sunshine. The well-proportioned kitchen and dining area enjoy an elevated outlook, creating a comfortable and practical hub for everyday family life.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms and two bathrooms are complemented by additional flexible spaces that could be used as a home office, study, hobby room or quiet retreat. This versatility makes the home particularly suitable for growing families, professionals working from home or those needing space for extended family.\r\nAdding further value, the home is equipped with a solar panel and battery system, helping to improve energy efficiency, reduce reliance on the grid and keep everyday power costs down.\r\n\r\nOutside, landscaped gardens, generous decking and private entertaining areas provide plenty of opportunities to enjoy the outdoors. A spa pool adds a relaxing finishing touch, while the separate laundry and characterful under-stair wine cellar bring further practicality and personality to the home.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n- Four bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n- Additional office, study or multipurpose spaces\r\n- Spacious two-level family layout\r\n- Solar panel and battery system for enhanced energy efficienc\r\n- Sun-filled, elevated living areas\r\n- Expansive balcony with excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Generous kitchen and dining area\r\n- Landscaped gardens and outdoor entertaining spaces\r\n- Private spa pool\r\n- Separate laundry\r\n- Under-stair wine cellar\r\n- Peaceful and established Half Moon Bay setting\r\n\r\nThe location brings everyday convenience within easy reach. Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry services, cafés, restaurants, FreshChoice and picturesque waterfront walkways are all nearby. Highland Park's supermarkets, shops and essential services are also conveniently accessible, along with local bus connections.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate access to sought-after local schools, historically including Pigeon Mountain Primary School, \r\n\r\nWakaaranga School, Farm Cove Intermediate and Pakuranga College. School zones should be independently confirmed.\r\n\r\nWhether you need space for a growing family, a dedicated work-from-home area, room for guests or simply more freedom to enjoy everyday life, this home offers possibilities well beyond the expected.\r\n\r\nCome and discover the space, sunshine and flexibility waiting for you at 14A Himalaya Drive.",
